# M4: a page with a header holding the page number field, and a footer.
@copy headers.rtf
@open HEADERS.RTF
f10 right right right right right right down down down down enter   # Document > Different First Page (off)
f10 down down down down enter          # File > Print...
o u t period p r n enter
f10 down down down down down enter     # File > Exit
n
